# Project doctrine

## Purpose
Every Partner invoice reaches Ledgerly exactly once, within 5 minutes of
receipt, and Finance can reconcile the nightly CSV against Ledgerly.

## Platform pins
- Node 22 (base image node:22-slim).
- PostgreSQL 16 (managed instance).

## Constraints
- Ledgerly is the system of record.

## Accepted decisions
- None recorded yet.

## Known debt
- The Partner webhook handler (src/routes/webhooks.ts) does the signature check,
  validation, the credit-limit Slack alert and the insert in one function.
  Accepted until the v3 ingest rewrite (2027 Q1).

## Settings
- Ledger: on
